    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiator Command</strong> is a strategic auto-battler set in the ruthless world of ancient Rome. As the master of a growing <i>ludus</i>, you'll manage a roster of unique gladiators, oversee training regimens, make critical recruitment decisions, and send your warriors into real-time, permadeath combat \u2014 all while building a legacy worthy of legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a clicker or idle game. Every gladiator is unique. Every death is permanent. Every victory reshapes your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train and manage</strong> your own stable of gladiators with distinct stats, traits, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe real-time battles</strong> where tactics, equipment, and morale matter more than luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit wisely</strong> from slave markets, dungeons, and rival schools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and adapt</strong> \u2014 once a gladiator dies in the arena, they\u2019re gone for good.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the ranks</strong> from unknown lanista to imperial champion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Legacy Systems</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retire legendary fighters to your <strong>Hall of Fame</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in multi-round <strong>tournaments</strong> for high rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost training with specialized <strong>trainers and gear</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in <strong>long-term strategies</strong> \u2014 not all victories come in the arena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gladiator Command</i> is built for players who crave meaningful choices, unforgiving stakes, and the slow-burning satisfaction of building power from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every battle is your test. Every decision writes history.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiator Command</strong> is a strategic auto-battler set in the ruthless world of ancient Rome. As the master of a growing <i>ludus</i>, you'll manage a roster of unique gladiators, oversee training regimens, make critical recruitment decisions, and send your warriors into real-time, permadeath combat \u2014 all while building a legacy worthy of legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a clicker or idle game. Every gladiator is unique. Every death is permanent. Every victory reshapes your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train and manage</strong> your own stable of gladiators with distinct stats, traits, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe real-time battles</strong> where tactics, equipment, and morale matter more than luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit wisely</strong> from slave markets, dungeons, and rival schools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and adapt</strong> \u2014 once a gladiator dies in the arena, they\u2019re gone for good.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the ranks</strong> from unknown lanista to imperial champion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Legacy Systems</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retire legendary fighters to your <strong>Hall of Fame</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in multi-round <strong>tournaments</strong> for high rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost training with specialized <strong>trainers and gear</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in <strong>long-term strategies</strong> \u2014 not all victories come in the arena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gladiator Command</i> is built for players who crave meaningful choices, unforgiving stakes, and the slow-burning satisfaction of building power from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every battle is your test. Every decision writes history.</strong></p>",
